1
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,000
Zhao Nanfeng is really tight-lipped.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,460
We caught her red-handed.

3
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,000
But she still won't confess.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Anyway, Zhao Beifeng
and Zhao Nanfeng are in custody.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,160
I don't believe she can

6
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,620
keep this hidden forever.

7
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:21,280
Zhou Yan,

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,880
contact the forensic center

9
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,800
and see if the matching results are out.

10
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,160
Okay,

11
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:26,160
I'll go right now.

12
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:32,880
Zhao Nanfeng.

13
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:41,920
Do you think threatening Zhou Yajun
to withdraw his appeal

14
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:43,580
means you can get away with it?

15
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,320
Prosecutor Fang,

16
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,720
it's just a job.

17
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,080
Why take it so seriously?

18
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,520
Did you receive

19
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,780
my brother's regards?

20
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:03,200
You have family and friends too.

21
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,400
You should know when

22
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,570
to let things go.

23
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,690
Are you threatening me?

24
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:13,340
Aren't you afraid?

25
00:01:16,720 --> 00:01:18,000
Why should I be?

26
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:20,200
Doesn't your threat

27
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,400
just prove that

28
00:01:22,039 --> 00:01:23,640
you're the one who's afraid?

29
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,400
Wei,

30
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:28,480
Why aren't you saying anything?

31
00:01:30,160 --> 00:01:31,360
I have no objections.

32
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:33,220
Let's look at the files first.

33
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,320
According to Liu Qian's confession,

34
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:38,120
the 300,000 Zhou Yawen

35
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,000
transferred to Zhao Nanfeng

36
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,400
wasn't an investment at all,

37
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:42,360
but extortion.

38
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,720
Then Zhao Nanfeng was lying

39
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:46,580
in his confession nine years ago.

40
00:01:47,479 --> 00:01:48,680
He hid it pretty well.

41
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:51,800
I'm wondering

42
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:52,920
if Zhao Nanfeng met Liu Qian

43
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,880
before seeing Zhou Yawen

44
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,479
on the night of the incident.

45
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,160
Liu Qian's hometown
is also in the suburbs,

46
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,690
right near the crime scene.

47
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,120
Could what she's hiding

48
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,520
be related to this?

49
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,160
On the night of the incident,

50
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,680
could their destination

51
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,210
have been Liu Qian's house?

52
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,040
Mr. Xu,

53
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,400
I have some thoughts.

54
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,600
I want to see Liu Qian.

55
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,560
Zhao Nanfeng's goal has always been money.

56
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,560
She had no reason to kill Zhou Yawen.

57
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,960
Then why did she take Zhou Yawen

58
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,020
to the suburbs on the day of the crime?

59
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,000
I don't know.

60
00:02:40,600 --> 00:02:41,130
Liu Qian,

61
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,600
your hometown, Liujia Village,

62
00:02:42,600 --> 00:02:45,200
happens to be in the direction
Zhao Nanfeng drove.

63
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:46,460
Is this a coincidence?

64
00:02:50,880 --> 00:02:52,680
I hope you can cooperate with us.

65
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:55,360
You also want to see Zhao Nanfeng
brought to justice, right?

66
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,040
Liu Qian.

67
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:57,440
The photos and videos Zhao Nanfeng used

68
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,200
to threaten you,

69
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,890
we can guarantee they won't be leaked.

70
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:04,280
You don't need to worry about anything.

71
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,520
Zhao Nanfeng

72
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,720
did come to me before.

73
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,440
She asked me for a place to stay.

74
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:17,280
I thought she just had nowhere to go

75
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,810
and wanted a place to crash.

76
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:22,079
I really didn't think too much about it.

77
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,960
I really didn't know.

78
00:03:25,079 --> 00:03:26,079
Don't be nervous.

79
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,050
Have some water.

80
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,320
Tell us in detail

81
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,180
what happened.

82
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,360
I heard you have an empty house

83
00:03:35,360 --> 00:03:36,640
in the village.

84
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,000
Yes.

85
00:03:40,200 --> 00:03:41,720
But it's very remote,

86
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,930
quite a distance from the village.

87
00:03:44,079 --> 00:03:45,320
I haven't been back

88
00:03:45,760 --> 00:03:47,160
since my mom passed away.

89
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,579
Give me the key.

90
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,160
What do you need

91
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,640
such a remote house for?

92
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,520
Knowing too much

93
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,560
won't do you any good.

94
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:06,520
Right,

95
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:08,920
find me a rope too.

96
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,920
A sturdy one.

97
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,240
Don't dawdle.

98
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,399
I'll reward you

99
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:20,720
once this is over.

100
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,360
If you dare breathe a word

101
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,280
about this...

102
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:29,160
I won't.

103
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,410
Zhao Nanfeng asked for the key,

104
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,600
so I gave it to her.

105
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:34,400
But she didn't use it.

106
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:35,720
Do you know

107
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,760
what Zhao Nanfeng was planning to do?

108
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,960
I have a rough idea.

109
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:41,800
She wanted to kidnap Zhou Yawen

110
00:04:42,159 --> 00:04:44,090
and extort money from her husband.

111
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,659
Did Zhao Nanfeng say that,

112
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:46,980
or is it your guess?

113
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,000
She mentioned it a few times.

114
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,600
Zhao Nanfeng had
Zhou Yawen's photos and videos.

115
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,680
She could've just sent them
to Gu Zhicheng.

116
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,680
Wouldn't kidnapping be unnecessary

117
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,360
and risky?

118
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:59,760
She also wanted to scare Zhou Yawen.

119
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:02,930
After all, they had a grudge
from the past.

120
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,520
And Zhou Yawen was living
such a good life.

121
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,520
Do you have proof?

122
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,960
I don't.

123
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,560
That's why I didn't report it

124
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,520
when something happened to Zhou Yawen.

125
00:05:14,520 --> 00:05:16,560
You can't just make accusations like that.

126
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,760
Please let me go.

127
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:18,960
Don't put me in jail.

128
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:19,760
I have a husband,

129
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,560
a family,

130
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,400
and kids.

131
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,360
I was really forced to do this.

132
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:23,760
Liu Qian,

133
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,620
we understand.

134
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,160
Don't get worked up.

135
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,020
Just calm down.

136
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,840
I was really forced.

137
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:35,800
The owner of the mysterious number
ending in 6129

138
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:36,600
is confirmed.

139
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,560
We checked all the cities

140
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,960
Zhao Nanfeng visited

141
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,320
from July 2012

142
00:05:41,320 --> 00:05:42,440
to June 2014,

143
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:43,040
and compared them with

144
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:46,100
the texts from local tourism bureaus
received by 6129.

145
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,700
The owner is Zhao Nanfeng.

146
00:05:47,840 --> 00:05:48,370
It's her.

147
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,159
What about the trajectory overlap results?

148
00:05:50,159 --> 00:05:50,960
They overlap.

149
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,000
I will submit an application

150
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,040
to the Provincial Procuratorate.

151
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,440
file a protest

152
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:02,560
with the provincial procuratorate

153
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:05,040
according to
the trial supervision process.

154
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,720
You handled the case very well.

155
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:07,250
Good job.

156
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:08,240
But

157
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:09,920
don't let your guard down

158
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:11,200
before the trial ends.

159
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:13,000
Make sure to wrap it up properly.

160
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,920
Rest assured.

161
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,240
The evidence is solid.

162
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,370
Zhao Nanfeng can't get away this time.

163
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:19,920
The prosecutor requests that

164
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:22,120
Lu Bixing from the Procuratorate
Technology Appraisal Center

165
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:24,520
testify in court as an expert witness.

166
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:26,570
Granted.

167
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:30,000
The Procuratorate
Technology Appraisal Center

168
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,360
focused on comparing the cell phone
signals of Zhou Yawen and Zhao Nanfeng

169
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,040
on the night of the crime,

170
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,960
and confirmed that

171
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:37,600
their signals were

172
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,000
overlapping that night.

173
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,840
We also identified the owner of another

174
00:06:40,840 --> 00:06:42,880
cell phone number ending in 6129.

175
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:43,940
It's Zhao Nanfeng.

176
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,800
On the night of the incident,

177
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,360
the base station signals
of the three phones

178
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,320
kept moving toward Caotang Street

179
00:06:47,320 --> 00:06:48,480
in the neighboring county

180
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:49,840
after leaving the city.

181
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,500
Zhao Nanfeng's two phones...

182
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:52,640
Hello,

183
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,120
Yawen.

184
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,300
Yawen, it's me.

185
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,440
Well,

186
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,970
I'm looking for you.

187
00:07:00,520 --> 00:07:01,120
How about

188
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,840
we meet up tonight?

189
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,370
How much money have I given you?

190
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:08,060
Are you ever going to stop?

191
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,640
Why are you so worked up?

192
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:16,640
We've known each other for so long.

193
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,600
You know me.

194
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,600
I told you last time

195
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,240
that it was the last time
I'd ask you for money.

196
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:23,170
And it definitely is the last time.

197
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:25,900
Then why are you still looking for me?

198
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:27,640
I've got

199
00:07:28,440 --> 00:07:29,680
enough money.

200
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,440
We won't see each other again.

201
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:36,240
But I still have some important things

202
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,440
to tell you in person.

203
00:07:40,360 --> 00:07:41,890
Just treat it as a farewell,

204
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:42,800
okay?

205
00:07:43,640 --> 00:07:44,770
Send me the address.

206
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,370
It's so late.

207
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,890
Where are you taking me?

208
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,280
Say something!

209
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,040
Stop the car!

210
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,960
Are you crazy?

211
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:03,370
Don't think I don't know
what you're up to.

212
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,040
It's just about money, isn't it?

213
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,040
To tell you the truth,

214
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:07,300
I've had enough of you.

215
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:09,240
I won't give you another cent.

216
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,320
You bastard!

217
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,140
You really think you're something, huh?

218
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:16,840
You're just selling yourself.

219
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:18,640
How dare you talk to me like that?

220
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,900
You can't threaten me.

221
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,920
I don't have any money for you anyway.

222
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:23,640
Kill me

223
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:25,610
if you have the guts!

224
00:08:25,840 --> 00:08:26,840
Don't be so sure.

225
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,520
See for yourself.

226
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:32,799
What if you regret it?

227
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:47,450
I made so much money for you.

228
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:49,890
And now you're using this
to screw me over?

229
00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:51,800
So what if I am?

230
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:55,500
You were such a slut
when you were making that money.

231
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:57,820
And now you're playing innocent with me?

232
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,420
If that's how it is,

233
00:09:00,640 --> 00:09:02,370
neither of us will have it easy.

234
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,330
You think this stuff

235
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,560
can threaten me?

236
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:07,180
I don't care at all.

237
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,580
Worst case, I'll get a divorce

238
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:11,360
and report you to the police.

239
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:13,160
We'll

240
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,000
go down together.

241
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:26,840
Master,

242
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:28,180
the verdict is out.

243
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,980
Death penalty.

244
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:42,400
Sister,

245
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,060
I finally got justice for you.

246
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,040
Don't worry.

247
00:10:50,880 --> 00:10:53,140
I'll take good care of Zixuan from now on.

248
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,400
Rest assured.

249
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,640
You still have me.

250
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,520
Right?

251
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,640
--Son.

252
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,660
Jiang Yuan,

253
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,600
that...

254
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,720
You actually want a divorce?

255
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:29,600
Aren't you afraid people
will laugh at us if word gets out?

256
00:12:29,600 --> 00:12:30,930
Is this about the socks?

257
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:33,040
It's that for all these years,

258
00:12:33,040 --> 00:12:35,200
you've never taken my words to heart.

259
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,680
How have I not taken them to heart?

260
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,320
When you just had Chengcheng,

261
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,200
you said you didn't want
to stay home with the baby.

262
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:44,800
I hired a nanny
without a second word, didn't I?

263
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:45,920
Do you know how much

264
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,120
financial pressure I was under back then?

265
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,680
Do you?

266
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:48,760
Didn't I say

267
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:50,820
we should split the cost of the nanny?

268
00:12:50,960 --> 00:12:51,840
You said

269
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,720
it would hurt your pride

270
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,720
if we did that,

271
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,720
so I compromised.

272
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,240
Are you really bringing this up now?

273
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:57,800
Pride?

274
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,600
Do I even have any pride left with you?

275
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:03,240
You trampled all over
my pride a long time ago.

276
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,320
I couldn't afford
that much money back then.

277
00:13:05,320 --> 00:13:07,400
I asked my mom to come
and help with the kid,

278
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,360
but you insisted

279
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:10,400
her parenting philosophy was flawed.

280
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,840
What parenting philosophy?

281
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,920
You're just arrogant and aloof.

282
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,040
You just look down on my mom.

283
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,120
I'll say it again.

284
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,400
I have nothing against your mother.

285
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,360
But the way she raised Chengcheng

286
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,440
was problematic.

287
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,640
You quit your job to raise the kid.

288
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:24,120
Fine.

289
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:32,280
I know you've suffered

290
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,400
a lot of grievances over the years.

291
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:37,000
But Chengcheng is almost 15 now,

292
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:39,730
and our family's
financial problems are solved.

293
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,240
If you divorce me now,

294
00:13:42,640 --> 00:13:43,240
it won't do

295
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,100
either of us

296
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:45,960
any good.

297
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:47,160
It's bad for you.

298
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:51,440
Because your career is already successful,

299
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,040
and you need a stable family

300
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:54,570
to build your public image.

301
00:13:58,520 --> 00:14:00,120
You never knew what I wanted.

302
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,960
When we first got married,

303
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,020
you were very busy.

304
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,160
I supported you.

305
00:14:04,160 --> 00:14:05,160
I understood you.

306
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,720
I thought you were doing it
for this family.

307
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:09,490
Only later did I realize

308
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:12,120
you were doing it
to fulfill your ambition.

309
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:14,280
I'll only say this once.

310
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:17,020
It's good that you have ambition.

311
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:20,090
You've indeed been climbing
the ladder these years.

312
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:23,400
But you can't do it
at the expense of your family.

313
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,640
Chengcheng and I are not fuel
for your ascent.

314
00:14:25,640 --> 00:14:26,720
I didn't.

315
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:28,520
Didn't you?

316
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:42,040
Sometimes I wonder

317
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:45,100
if you ever cared about us.

318
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:49,440
Where were you
when I gave birth to Chengcheng?

319
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,160
Where were you when he had a high fever,
got pneumonia,

320
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:53,080
and went

321
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:53,760
to the ER?

322
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,200
Have you ever attended
a parent-teacher meeting

323
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,000
since he started kindergarten?

324
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,440
Jiang Yuan,

325
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,840
do you really want me
to spell it out so harshly?

326
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,730
Being busy with work

327
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:11,080
is just an excuse to avoid
your family responsibilities.

328
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,240
Fine.

329
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,200
After all these years,

330
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:19,760
I

331
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:22,770
worked my heart out for you and the kid.

332
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,840
And in your eyes, I'm just a selfish,

333
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,520
utilitarian person.

334
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,500
Congratulations.

335
00:15:32,400 --> 00:15:34,060
You finally see me for who I am.

336
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,700
You want a divorce, right?

337
00:15:39,480 --> 00:15:40,740
After all these years,

338
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,880
how do you want to split the house,

339
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,440
the car,

340
00:15:43,760 --> 00:15:44,280
and the

341
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,640
savings?

342
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,880
We can't tell the difference at all.

343
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,840
No need to calculate.

344
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:56,140
I don't want anything.

345
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,410
I only want Chengcheng.

346
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,800
Sign it.

347
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:26,010
Spill it.

348
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:27,820
Spill what?

349
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:29,410
About the medicine.

350
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:31,560
Are you really going to
make me interrogate you?

351
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,160
Early-stage breast cancer.

352
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:34,160
An 85% survival rate

353
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,600
within five years.

354
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,840
I'm much luckier than my mom.

355
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:42,040
What are you doing?

356
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:43,170
Don't be so nervous.

357
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,460
It's nothing serious.

358
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:46,690
Don't treat me like a special case.

359
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:49,760
Treat you like a special case?

360
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:50,680
You wish.

361
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:53,140
Actually, when I first found out,

362
00:16:53,840 --> 00:16:54,700
I panicked too.

363
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,610
I kept thinking about
when my mom got sick.

364
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:01,520
Forget it.

365
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:02,650
It's all in the past.

366
00:17:02,840 --> 00:17:03,970
Then what's going on

367
00:17:04,119 --> 00:17:05,579
with you and your husband?

368
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,200
Don't think I can't tell.

369
00:17:07,560 --> 00:17:09,119
Nothing escapes your eyes.

370
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:14,000
We're in a cooling-off period right now.

371
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:14,920
But I can tell

372
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:16,099
he hasn't moved on.

373
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,900
Then you should think it through.

374
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:21,160
After all, you've been together
for so many years.

375
00:17:21,160 --> 00:17:22,839
I've thought it through very clearly.

376
00:17:22,839 --> 00:17:25,170
I was very calm when making this decision.

377
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,370
Everything is fair.

378
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:31,760
To others,

379
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:34,490
my career and family are going perfectly.

380
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,080
But only I know

381
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:38,610
what my life is really like.

382
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,100
Jiang Yuan and I

383
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:43,500
have had incompatible values for years.

384
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:45,960
Forcing ourselves to keep living together

385
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,480
is torture for both of us.

386
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,370
Matters of the heart

387
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:53,770
can't be explained in just a few words.

388
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,880
But this illness also

389
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:59,930
made me re-examine my past.

390
00:18:00,840 --> 00:18:01,560
I realized

391
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,400
I've been deceiving myself all along

392
00:18:04,400 --> 00:18:06,530
for the sake of so-called perfection.

393
00:18:06,600 --> 00:18:09,260
Now I just want to truly live
for myself for once.

394
00:18:12,600 --> 00:18:13,120
Yishan,

395
00:18:14,560 --> 00:18:17,600
I really don't have much experience
with relationships.

396
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:19,760
And I'm not very good
at comforting people either.

397
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:20,720
But I respect

398
00:18:21,280 --> 00:18:22,680
all your decisions.

399
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:27,080
Thank you for supporting me.

400
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:30,570
Then promise me one more thing.

401
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,140
Don't look so serious.

402
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:34,080
Cheer up.

403
00:18:36,040 --> 00:18:37,240
I'm quite happy.

404
00:18:37,840 --> 00:18:38,970
Then give me a smile.

405
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,080
Alright,

406
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,480
I'll let you off the hook.

407
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:45,220
Come on,

408
00:18:46,400 --> 00:18:47,080
here's to me

409
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:49,160
starting a new life.

410
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:50,680
Congratulations.
